[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10500.55, "timestamp": "02:55:00", "text": "嗯。我基本上一个人住。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10504.309, "timestamp": "02:55:04", "text": "就像我不用付房租一样。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10505.07, "timestamp": "02:55:05", "text": "一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10507.83, "timestamp": "02:55:07", "text": "例外。否则，我所有的事情都做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10527.71, "timestamp": "02:55:27", "text": "但你将搬去日本。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10532.15, "timestamp": "02:55:32", "text": "是啊，我很担心。这将是如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10535.51, "timestamp": "02:55:35", "text": "现在正经历文化冲击。不，就像我的朋友一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10537.83, "timestamp": "02:55:37", "text": "就像我的一个朋友，她当时在……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10539.59, "timestamp": "02:55:39", "text": "交换"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10543.349, "timestamp": "02:55:43", "text": "呃，那个把她送到日本的项目"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10547.59, "timestamp": "02:55:47", "text": "然后带一个到印度去。啊，交易所"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10550.429, "timestamp": "02:55:50", "text": "学生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10553.429, "timestamp": "02:55:53", "text": "哦。我想她在那里住了两年。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10557.03, "timestamp": "02:55:57", "text": "多年过去了，她说，就像她说的那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10558.71, "timestamp": "02:55:58", "text": "仿佛那是她人生中最美好的两年。"}]